---
import '../styles/editor.css';
const {code='print("Hello, little universe!")\n\n# What will you make today?\n',input='',expected='',lesson='',storageKey='playground',playground=false}=Astro.props;
---
<section class="python-editor" data-code={code} data-input={input} data-expected={expected} data-lesson={lesson} data-storage={storageKey} data-playground={playground?'yes':'no'} aria-label="Interactive Python editor">
<div class="editor-toolbar"><span><b class="file-dot"></b> my_adventure.py</span><span class="engine-label">Python · in your browser</span></div>
<div class="editor-columns"><div class="code-side"><div class="editor-label"><label for="python-code">Your code</label><button class="editor-text-button" id="insert-indent" title="Insert four spaces at the cursor">+ Indent</button></div><div class="code-area"><pre id="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true">1</pre><textarea id="python-code" class="code" maxlength="50000" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" aria-describedby="editor-help" wrap="off">{code}</textarea></div><p class="editor-help" id="editor-help">Edit the code. Then run it. Ctrl / ⌘ + Enter also works.</p></div><div class="output-side"><div class="editor-label"><span id="output-label">Output</span><span>YOUR IDEAS, ALIVE</span></div><pre id="python-output" tabindex="0" aria-labelledby="output-label">Your program’s output will appear here.

Ready when you are. ✦</pre></div></div>
<div class="editor-bottom"><div class="editor-buttons"><button class="button" id="python-run">▶ {expected?'Run & check goal':'Run code'}</button><button class="button white" id="python-stop" disabled>■ Stop</button><button class="editor-text-button" id="python-reset">Reset code</button><button class="editor-text-button" id="python-download">Download .py ↓</button></div><p id="python-status" role="status">The first run loads Python. This can take a moment.</p></div>
<div class="input-drawer"><details open={!!input}><summary>Program input <span>For programs that use input()</span></summary><label for="python-input">Answers, one per line, in the order your program asks</label><textarea id="python-input" rows="3" maxlength="10000" placeholder="Example:&#10;Nova&#10;12">{input}</textarea><p class="tiny">Add answers before you run. Each input() reads the next line. Use made-up names and details.</p></details></div>
<noscript><p class="feedback">JavaScript is needed to run Python. You can still read the lessons and copy the examples.</p></noscript>
</section><p class="tiny">Real Python, powered by <a href="https://pyodide.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pyodide</a>. Standard-library programs work here; desktop windows, turtle graphics, and package installation are not supported by this editor. Programs stop after 10 seconds of execution.</p><dialog id="editor-reset-dialog"><h2>Back to the starting code?</h2><p>This replaces your edits for this activity. Download your code first if you want to keep it.</p><div class="actions"><button class="button" id="confirm-code-reset">Reset code</button><form method="dialog"><button class="button ghost">Keep editing</button></form></div></dialog>
<script>import '../scripts/python';</script>
